
    ORGAN DOSE CONVERSION FACTORS FOR AN ADULT HERMAPHRODITE
    CALCULATED FOR A VARIETY OF CT SCANNERS AND CONDITIONS.
    VALUES ARE GIVEN FOR 208 5 MM SLICES SPANNING THE BODY
    FROM 100 MM BELOW THE BOTTOM OF THE TRUNK TO THE TOP OF THE HEAD.

                     ORGANS OR REGIONS
 1 ADRENALS              10 HEART                  19 THYMUS                   
 2 BRAIN                 11 KIDNEYS                20 THYROID                  
 3 BREASTS               12 LIVER                  21 URINARY BLADDER          
 4 EYE LENSES            13 LUNGS                  22 UTERUS                   
 5 GALL BLADDER          14 OVARIES                23 HEAD REGION              
 6 STOMACH               15 PANCREAS               24 TRUNK REGION             
 7 SMALL INTESTINE       16 SKIN                   25 LEG REGION               
 8 UPPER LARGE INTESTINE 17 SPLEEN                 26 SKELETON                 
 9 LOWER LARGE INTESTINE 18 TESTICLES              27 RED MARROW               

 01 SIEMENS SOMATOM 2,DR1/2/3: NO SHAPED FILTER
    FOCUS TO AXIS DISTANCE IS 760 MM
    FAN ANGLE COVERS FULL WIDTH OF TRUNK
    X-RAY SPECTRUM HAS MAXIMUM ENERGY OF 125 KEV
    FILTRATION IS 2.2 MM OF ALUMINIUM AND 0.25 MM OF COPPER

    CONVERSION FACTORS AND STATISTICAL UNCERTAINTIES(%) FOR ORGANS IN EACH SLICE
